    "detailed_description": "<strong>The Echo Whispers</strong> has finished in the TOP 5 of the PJP Game Jam and it was made in 72 hours. Now the story is bigger with more details.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Synopsis</h2>Amy isolates herself in a small cabin in order to regain her sanity, she just didn't imagine being alone with herself was the problem. Help Amy overcome what even she doesn't know.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The Gameplay</h2>This game is primarily a first-person narrative walking simulator with tasks and exploration mechanics.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>PS1 style aesthetic with camera filters;<br></li><li>Secret tapes with hidden story details;<br></li><li>Dialogues;<br></li><li>Voice acting full generated by AI.</li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<strong>The Echo Whispers</strong> has finished in the TOP 5 of the PJP Game Jam and it was made in 72 hours. Now the story is bigger with more details.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Synopsis</h2>Amy isolates herself in a small cabin in order to regain her sanity, she just didn't imagine being alone with herself was the problem. Help Amy overcome what even she doesn't know.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The Gameplay</h2>This game is primarily a first-person narrative walking simulator with tasks and exploration mechanics.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>PS1 style aesthetic with camera filters;<br></li><li>Secret tapes with hidden story details;<br></li><li>Dialogues;<br></li><li>Voice acting full generated by AI.</li></ul>",
